{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20319","headline":"樵客吟 · 张籍","name":"樵客吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上山采樵选枯树，深处樵多出辛苦。\n秋来野火烧栎林，枝柯已枯堪采取。\n斧声坎坎在幽谷，采得齐梢青葛束。\n日西待伴同下山，竹担弯弯向身曲。\n共知路傍多虎窟，未出深林不敢歇。\n村西地暗狐兔行，稚子呌时相应声。\n采樵客，莫采松与栢。\n松栢生枝直且坚，与君作屋成家宅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20319.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20319","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}